// Three things worth noticing:
//   1. Specific model ARNs, not bedrock:* — a new expensive model cannot be
//      invoked without a policy change.
//   2. ${aws:PrincipalTag/tenantId} gives per-tenant isolation from one policy
//      rather than one policy per tenant.
//   3. The explicit deny wins over any allow, including future ones.

